       "text": "We use the GitHub developers site-maven-plugin to deploy documentation at release time to Github Pages via a gh-pages branch within the repo. This plugin is taking a long time to run and eventually fails with a 502, presumably due to a timeout talking to the GitHub servers. The plugin is no longer maintained and the GH repo is archived. There is a workaround for replicating this deployment methodology described at ",
