  "description": "<p>We use the GitHub developers site-maven-plugin to deploy documentation at release time to Github Pages via a gh-pages branch within the repo. This plugin is taking a long time to run and eventually fails with a 502, presumably due to a timeout talking to the GitHub servers. The plugin is no longer maintained and the GH repo is archived. There is a workaround for replicating this deployment methodology described at <a href=\"https://wiki.bitplan.com/index.php/Multi-Module_Maven_with_github_pages\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.bitplan.com/index.php/Multi-Module_Maven_with_github_pages</a> </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/github/maven-plugins/issues/136\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/github/maven-plugins/issues/136</a> </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/github/maven-plugins/issues/139\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/github/maven-plugins/issues/139</a> </p>",
